            "code": "# Generate and display a 10x10 multiplication table for 1-10.\nheaders = list(range(1, 11))\ntable = [[i*j for j in headers] for i in headers]\n\n# Pretty-print as markdown\nmd = \"| × | \" + \" | \".join(map(str, headers)) + \" |\\n\"\nmd += \"|---\" * 11 + \"|\\n\"\nfor i, row in enumerate(table, start=1):\n    md += f\"| {i} | \" + \" | \".join(map(str, row)) + \" |\\n\"\n\nprint(md)\n",
